// pi custom models — Bitdeer AI (OpenAI-compatible endpoint).
//
// contextWindow/maxTokens are gateway-verified, not vendor headline: the gateway
// 400s (masked into a generic "invalid request" pi can't recover from) once
// prompt + max_completion_tokens exceed the pod's real limit, and compaction
// fires at contextWindow − reserveTokens. Oversized requests may not 400 at
// all — the gateway can silently fall back to another pool serving a
// different model, so contextWindow is the serving pool's real limit, never
// just what the gateway accepts (limits differ per pool/region: GLM-5.3-Flash
// was 262144-capped on the JP pool, SG serves it 1M+). 1M-class models sit at
// 1000000, not the weights' raw 1048576, for boundary headroom.
//
// Every model emits reasoning_content. The gateway takes
// minimal|low|medium|high|xhigh|max for every model and 400s on any other value
// (an unknown value does not fall back to the default); only DS-V4.1-Flash also
// takes "none", where it and an omitted field both yield zero reasoning tokens.
// thinkingLevelMap null = level hidden; xhigh/max are unavailable unless mapped,
// lower levels clamp up to the nearest mapped one.
//
// compat facts (family-wide; canonical here, per-model notes inline):
// - requiresReasoningContentOnAssistantMessages = Preserved Thinking replay of
//   prior turns' reasoning_content — required for K3 multi-turn/tool-call
//   continuity, harmless for the rest.
// - supportsDeveloperRole=false on DS+GLM: their pods ignore role "developer",
//   so strict-JSON contracts degrade to prose with latency spikes. K3 is the
//   opposite — verified compliant under developer. Change only with a
//   gateway-side fix, then re-verify with the probe.
//
// Request lifetime: streaming completions are hard-cut at ≈600s wall-clock
// (Envoy route timeout behind Cloudflare; reproduced on K3 and DS-Flash pools).
// The SSE stream ends cleanly — no finish_reason, no usage — so a long
// generation surfaces as a silently truncated 200. Effective per-request output
// is speed-bound, whatever maxTokens says: ≈50K tokens at ~85 tok/s (K3),
// ≈90K at ~150 tok/s (DS-V4.1-Flash-1017). Raise the gateway timeout before raising any
// maxTokens.
//
// The aigw provider below is a different service: the AI Gateway (LiteLLM in
// front of AWS Bedrock, ap-southeast-1, global.* cross-region inference
// profiles). It is the only route to company Claude models — the api-inference
// pool above serves open models only. Aliases map to:
//   claude-opus     → global.anthropic.claude-opus-5-5               (current)
//   claude-sonnet   → global.anthropic.claude-sonnet-5-5             (current)
//   claude-sonnet-5 → global.anthropic.claude-sonnet-5               (pinned, 64K out)
//   claude-haiku    → global.anthropic.claude-haiku-4-5-20251001-v1:0 (a generation behind Haiku 5.5)
// Read those from GET /model/info, not from the Confluence user guide — that
// page still names Sonnet 5 for claude-sonnet; the gateway serves 5.5.
//
// aigw compat facts, probe-verified against the live endpoint:
// - thinking.adaptive.block_binding is rejected ("Extra inputs are not
//   permitted"), the same failure class as Claude Code's context_management
//   error against this gateway. compat.supportsMidConvoEffort therefore stays
//   false even though the vendor models support managed mid-conversation effort
//   — pi emits block_binding only when that flag is on. forceAdaptiveThinking
//   alone produces the accepted shape: thinking {type: adaptive, display} plus
//   output_config {effort}.
// - anthropic-beta headers are not validated: unknown betas, including a
//   deliberately bogus one, return 200. No header suppression needed.
// - Budget-based thinking is silently ignored on the 5.x models (zero thinking
//   tokens, no thinking block) and honored on Haiku 4.5 — hence Haiku alone
//   omits forceAdaptiveThinking. Thinking-off is why the 5.x entries map off to
//   null: Opus 5.5 rejects thinking {"type": "disabled"} outright ("Use
//   adaptive and output_config.effort") and Sonnet 5.5 answers it with a 400
//   demanding {"type": "between_tools"}; an unmapped level makes pi clamp off up
//   to a supported one instead of sending either.
// - Haiku 4.5 rejects a tool that carries both eager_input_streaming and strict
//   ("tools.0.custom.eager_input_streaming: Extra inputs are not permitted"); the
//   5.x models accept both. supportsEagerToolInputStreaming:false is the fix —
//   strict tool use survives, and the fine-grained-tool-streaming beta it swaps
//   in costs nothing since betas are unvalidated.
// - The gateway creates a 1h ephemeral prompt cache with no cache_control marker
//   in the request, so usage reports the cached remainder rather than the prompt:
//   a ~370K-token probe returned input_tokens 4 with cache_creation_input_tokens
//   370980. pi-ai maps cache_creation to cacheWrite (and the nested ephemeral_1h
//   count to cacheWrite1h), so cost stays honest — but the promptCache tiers
//   above buy nothing here.
// - cost is vendor list price. The gateway's /model_group/info still bills
//   claude-opus at Opus-5 rates ($5/$25 against $4/$20), so its chargeback
//   report and pi's footer can disagree.
{
  "$schema": "https://pi.dev/schemas/models.schema.json",
  "providers": {
    "bitdeerai": {
      "baseUrl": "https://api-inference.bitdeer.ai/v1",
      "api": "openai-completions",
      "apiKey": "$BITDEERAI_API_KEY",
      "models": [
        {
          // Multimodal (image input gateway-probed). Effort off/low/high/max;
          // off = "none", verified 0 reasoning tokens. Provider "low" thinks
          // less than "minimal" (~114 vs ~186), so both pi levels below medium
          // resolve to "low".
          // max_completion_tokens caps reasoning + visible combined — small
          // caps can yield empty visible content. 1M+ ctx probe-verified:
          // prompt 1,044,062 + completion → 200. Decode ~150–195 tok/s.
          "id": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017",
          "reasoning": true,
          "input": [
            "text",
            "image"
          ],
          "thinkingLevelMap": {
            "off": "none",
            "minimal": null,
            "low": "low",
            "medium": null,
            "high": "high",
            "xhigh": null,
            "max": "max"
          },
          "contextWindow": 1000000,
          "maxTokens": 384000,
          "cost": {
            "input": 0.3,
            "output": 1.2,
            "cacheRead": 0.006,
            "cacheWrite": 0
          },
          "compat": {
            "supportsDeveloperRole": false,
            "supportsReasoningEffort": true,
            "requiresReasoningContentOnAssistantMessages": true
          }
        },
        {
          // Always thinks (an omitted field still reasons heavily, "none" 400s).
          // Effort changes invalidate its prefix
          // cache — one effort per session; never switch INTO K3 mid-session.
          // 1M+ ctx probe-verified: prompt 1,027,109 + completion → 200.
          "id": "moonshotai/Kimi-K3",
          "reasoning": true,
          "thinkingLevelMap": {
            "off": null,
            "minimal": null,
            "low": "low",
            "medium": null,
            "high": "high",
            "xhigh": null,
            "max": "max"
          },
          "contextWindow": 1000000,
          "maxTokens": 131072,
          "input": [
            "text",
            "image"
          ],
          "cost": {
            "input": 3,
            "output": 15,
            "cacheRead": 0.3,
            "cacheWrite": 0
          },
          "compat": {
            "supportsReasoningEffort": true,
            "requiresReasoningContentOnAssistantMessages": true
          }
        },
        {
          // Text-only. GLM family: two effort regimes, not six — low/high reason
          // adaptively (~40–90 tokens on a trivial prompt, more as difficulty
          // grows) while minimal/medium/xhigh/max and an omitted field all force
          // the heavy profile (~470–535 full-size, ~220–350 Flash).
          "id": "zai-org/GLM-5.3",
          "reasoning": true,
          "thinkingLevelMap": {
            "off": null,
            "minimal": null,
            "low": "low",
            "medium": null,
            "high": "high",
            "xhigh": null,
            "max": "max"
          },
          "contextWindow": 1000000,
          "maxTokens": 131072,
          "cost": {
            "input": 1.4,
            "output": 4.4,
            "cacheRead": 0.26,
            "cacheWrite": 0
          },
          "compat": {
            "supportsDeveloperRole": false,
            "supportsReasoningEffort": true,
            "requiresReasoningContentOnAssistantMessages": true
          }
        },
        {
          // Vision-capable. SG pool serves 1M+ — probe-verified: prompt 1,026,932 +
          // completion → 200, response model zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash (no cross-pool
          // fallback). Can burn the whole max_completion_tokens budget as
          // reasoning_content below ~512.
          "id": "zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash",
          "reasoning": true,
          "input": [
            "text",
            "image"
          ],
          "thinkingLevelMap": {
            "off": null,
            "minimal": null,
            "low": "low",
            "medium": null,
            "high": "high",
            "xhigh": null,
            "max": "max"
          },
          "contextWindow": 1000000,
          "maxTokens": 131072,
          "cost": {
            "input": 0.15,
            "output": 0.5,
            "cacheRead": 0.03,
            "cacheWrite": 0
          },
          "compat": {
            "supportsDeveloperRole": false,
            "supportsReasoningEffort": true,
            "requiresReasoningContentOnAssistantMessages": true
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "aigw": {
      "baseUrl": "https://aigw.bitdeer.vip",
      "api": "anthropic-messages",
      "apiKey": "$AIGW_API_KEY",
      "models": [
        {
          "id": "claude-opus",
          "name": "Claude Opus 5.5",
          "reasoning": true,
          "input": [
            "text",
            "image"
          ],
          "contextWindow": 1000000,
          "maxTokens": 128000,
          "promptCache": {
            "short": 300,
            "long": 3600
          },
          "cost": {
            "input": 4,
            "output": 20,
            "cacheRead": 0.2,
            "cacheWrite": 5
          },
          "thinkingLevelMap": {
            "off": null,
            "minimal": null,
            "low": "low",
            "medium": "medium",
            "high": "high",
            "xhigh": "xhigh",
            "max": "max"
          },
          "compat": {
            "forceAdaptiveThinking": true,
            "supportsStrictTools": true,
            "supportsTemperature": false
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "claude-sonnet",
          "name": "Claude Sonnet 5.5",
          "reasoning": true,
          "input": [
            "text",
            "image"
          ],
          "contextWindow": 1000000,
          "maxTokens": 128000,
          "promptCache": {
            "short": 300,
            "long": 3600
          },
          "cost": {
            "input": 2,
            "output": 10,
            "cacheRead": 0.1,
            "cacheWrite": 2.5
          },
          "thinkingLevelMap": {
            "off": null,
            "minimal": null,
            "low": "low",
            "medium": "medium",
            "high": "high",
            "xhigh": "xhigh",
            "max": "max"
          },
          "compat": {
            "forceAdaptiveThinking": true,
            "supportsStrictTools": true,
            "supportsTemperature": false
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "claude-sonnet-5",
          "name": "Claude Sonnet 5",
          "reasoning": true,
          "input": [
            "text",
            "image"
          ],
          "contextWindow": 1000000,
          "maxTokens": 64000,
          "promptCache": {
            "short": 300,
            "long": 3600
          },
          "cost": {
            "input": 2,
            "output": 10,
            "cacheRead": 0.2,
            "cacheWrite": 2.5
          },
          "thinkingLevelMap": {
            "xhigh": "xhigh",
            "max": "max"
          },
          "compat": {
            "forceAdaptiveThinking": true,
            "supportsStrictTools": true
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "claude-haiku",
          "name": "Claude Haiku 4.5",
          "reasoning": true,
          "input": [
            "text",
            "image"
          ],
          "contextWindow": 200000,
          "maxTokens": 64000,
          "promptCache": {
            "short": 300,
            "long": 3600
          },
          "cost": {
            "input": 1,
            "output": 5,
            "cacheRead": 0.1,
            "cacheWrite": 1.25
          },
          "compat": {
            "supportsEagerToolInputStreaming": false,
            "supportsStrictTools": true
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}